OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACriminals who skip sentencing will face
OL,4,Asolitary confinement or lose social
OL,5,Avisits
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe move is the latest bid to push
OL,8,Fkillers to attend court, with the
OL,9,FMinistry of Justice acknowledging that
OL,10,Flonger jail time alone is unlikely to
OL,11,Fdeter those already behind bars.
OL,13,F"Criminals should not be able to pick
OL,14,Fand choose when they face justice,"
OL,15,FPrisons Minister Catherine McKinnell
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
